{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛知県出身22歳の岡本姫奈です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日のリアルミーグリ\nありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初めましての方も沢山会いに来てくれて！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しかったー！！💌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "会いに来てくれたみんなが\n「またひなに会いたいなぁ💭」って思っていますように！！！🥺"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "舞台のお話だったり、\nアンダーライブのお話だったり、\nアルバム発売記念ライブのお話も！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とにかく話したいこと沢山だったね😂"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何よりも 直接会えたのが嬉しかった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リアルサイン会では\n時間の限りメッセージを書きました〜💌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "受け取った色紙を大事そうに抱えて\n嬉しそうに帰っていくみんなの姿が愛おしくてたまらなかったです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1日目はてれとおそろいパジャマコーデでした！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobt4N5Kq.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ふわふわすぎて寝る時これ以外着たくないー！って思っちゃうくらい最高の着心地です笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "部屋着は大体ライブTシャツなんですが、、\n戻れなさそう笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お花も 沢山！！ ありがとう😭\nリアルミーグリ2日目\nレーンに着いたらお花が増えててびっくりしたよ〜笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "めちゃくちゃ嬉しいサプライズでした🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobP5kHjL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また早く会いたいー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近はアンダーライブに向けてリハーサルを頑張っています💃"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6期生ちゃんが 一生懸命練習してる姿を見て私も毎日勇気をもらってます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "チケットの一般先着販売＆配信も決定しました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🔗https://www.nogizaka46.com/s/n46/page/underlive"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなで作り上げるアンダーライブ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来てよかった。と思っていただけるような\n皆さんの心に残り続けるような時間にします。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "是非見届けてくださったら嬉しいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんに会えるのを楽しみに今日も自主練習頑張る！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また書きます！！☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobYXKXOC.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mob35sieQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "花粉😡いや！！！🤧"}], "source": "official"}